    "answer": "(approximate)-time/around/about/toward | suitable-time-(or-condition) | time-of-year/season",
    "mnemonic": "The kanji and the word are exactly the same. That means they share meanings as well. When used as a suffix, it means <vocabulary>approximate time</vocabulary> and <vocabulary>around</vocabulary> (as in \"around 3:00\").",
